trademarks they show; they are used here under the terms of the original theme, which is NOT AUTHORIZED FOR COMMERCIAL USE.

The layout files for EmulationStation-fcamod (theme.xml, aspect-ratio-4-3.xml, _inc/legend.xml, _inc/video-*.xml, the language files) and the
scripts that adapt the art are by jovemlcxx and are shared under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/).

